			"notes": "**Industrial Legacy**\n**Version:** Alpha 0.1.9\n\n**Dev Blog:**\n\n⚡ **Energy and Generators**\n• Added the Radioisotope Thermoelectric Generator.\n• Added the Solar Panel.\n• Added the Semifluid Generator.\n• Added Charging Crystals of all types.\n• Added Energy Packs of all types.\n• Added the Solar Helmet.\n• Added Static Boots.\n• Fixed energy storage block drops — stored energy is now preserved.\n• Fixed charge and discharge slot logic.\n\n🌬️ **Kinetics and Wind Power**\n• Added the Kinetic Generator.\n• Added the Wind Kinetic Generator.\n• Added Rotors of all types.\n• Added Rotor Blades of all types.\n• Added the Wind Meter.\n• Improved Splitter Cable and Detector Cable logic.\n\n🏭 **Machines and Processing**\n• Added the Recycler.\n• Added the Induction Furnace.\n• Added the Ore Washing Plant.\n• Added the Extractor.\n• Added the Fluid Bottler.\n• Added the Pump.\n• Added the Mining Pipe.\n• Added the Solar Distiller.\n• Fixed incorrect Thermal Centrifuge values.\n• Fixed the interfaces of many machines, including layout issues caused by font differences between 1.12.2 and 1.20.1.\n• Fixed the Canning Machine interface.\n• Fixed the Containment Box interface.\n• Fixed the Tool Box interface.\n\n🧪 **Fluids, Cells and Materials**\n• Added all fluids and their cell variants.\n• Added Storage Boxes of all types.\n• Added Iodine.\n• Added Slag.\n• Added Netherrack Dust.\n• Added Tiny Piles of Emerald Dust.\n• Added Bobs-Yer-Uncle-Ranks Berries.\n• Added Rubber Sheets, Latex Sheets and Wool Sheets.\n• Added Fertilizer.\n• Added Scrap.\n• Added the Scrap Box.\n\n🧱 **Blocks and Construction**\n• Added the Lead Block.\n• Added the Bronze Block.\n• Added the Tin Block.\n• Added the Silver Block.\n• Added the Steel Block.\n• Added Scaffolds of all types.\n• Added Construction Foam and Reinforced Construction Foam.\n• Added the CF Sprayer.\n• Added Construction Foam Walls.\n• Added Reinforced Stone.\n• Added the CF Pack.\n• Updated the Rubber Sapling texture.\n\n🔧 **Tools and Equipment**\n• Reworked Wrench mechanics.\n• Added the Electric Hoe.\n• Added the Electric Treetap.\n• Added the Electric Wrench.\n• Added Painters of all colors.\n• Added colored cables.\n• Added the Biogas Jetpack.\n• Removed the Debug Wrench.\n\n⬆️ **Upgrades and Compatibility**\n• Added the upgrade system — previously inactive upgrade slots now work.\n• Added all upgrades.\n• Added full JEI compatibility.\n• Fully migrated recipes from `.json` to `.ini` — all recipes now use the new format.\n\n🧹 **Cleanup, Debugging and Optimization**\n• Removed Aluminum and all of its derivatives.\n• Added debugging tools: recipe statistics are now reported in detail in the logs and can also be viewed with `/il recipes_log`.\n• Optimized project assets — the final asset size is now roughly 2x smaller."
		},
