			"notes": "**Industrial Legacy**\n**Version:** Alpha 0.1.8\n\n**Dev Blog:**\n\n☢️⚛️ **Nuclear Reactor**\n• Added the Nuclear Reactor.\n• Added reactor components.\n• Added nuclear fuel and related byproducts.\n\n🧪 **Uranium and Radiation**\n• Added all uranium types and their crafting recipes.\n• Added radiation.\n• Added a new radiation effect texture.\n\n🏭 **Machines and Processing**\n• Added the Canning Machine.\n• Added the Filler.\n• Added the Thermal Centrifuge.\n• Added the Metal Former.\n• Added the Electric Motor.\n• Added the Coil.\n\n🔫⚒️ **Tools and Equipment**\n• Added the Mining Laser.\n• Added a universal mode switch key.\n• Added the Toolbox.\n• Added the Drill, Diamond Drill, and Iridium Drill.\n• Added the Electric Chainsaw.\n\n🛡🥉 **Bronze and Armor**\n• Added all bronze items: armor, tools, and weapon.\n• Added the Composite Chestplate.\n\n🔋 **Energy Blocks and UI**\n• Added all Charge Pads.\n• Fixed mode button textures.\n• Globally fixed the Luminator behavior and model.\n\n🪛 **Fixes and Cleanup**\n• Removed outdated wrapper classes.\n• Removed the outdated screen wrapper.\n• Fixed some tooltips and item names."
