			"notes": "**Industrial Legacy**\n**Version:** Alpha 0.1.7\n\n**Dev Blog**\n\n🔌⚡ **Electronics**\n• Added the Lapotron Crystal.\n• Added the MFSU.\n• Added the MFE to MFSU Upgrade Kit.\n• Added the Geothermal Generator.\n• Added the Electric Furnace.\n• Added the Advanced Machine Casing.\n\n🪖 **Armor and Equipment**\n• Added the Jetpack.\n• Added the Hazmat Suit.\n• Added the Quantum Armor. It still requires further balancing for full IC2 accuracy.\n\n⚙️ **Mechanics**\n• Added fluid cells for water, lava, and air.\n• Added a universal Hover Mode and its keybind.\n• Added the Wrench. Machine breaking rules are now closer to IC2.\n\n🪛 **Fixes**\n• Fixed the iron fence. Due to a bug, it behaved like a post and did not connect to other fence blocks."
		},
